      { from: '2027-10-08', why: 'Geng Xu month — Seven Killings on the stem and Geng Metal facing Jia: pressure peaks; keep commitments light, health first.' },
      { from: '2027-06-06', why: 'Bing Wu month — Eating God over Hurting Officer: output overflows and patience runs out; finish things before starting new ones.' }
