      { q: 'What does a Seven Killings year mean?', a: 'Seven Killings is the element that controls yours in the same polarity — the harsh boss, the rival, the crisis, the ambition that will not let you rest; for women, the intense form of the partner star. A Seven Killings year brings pressure, risk, and decisiveness. It can wound a weak chart and forge a strong one. Resource is the classic remedy, and 2027 supplies it in the Wei branch.' },
      { q: 'When should Xin Metal make money moves in 2027?', a: 'Early spring: Ren Yin from 4 February (Direct Wealth in the branch), Gui Mao from 6 March (Eating God producing Indirect Wealth — the cleanest earning month), and Jia Chen from 5 April (Direct Wealth over Direct Resource, money with protection). Yi Si from 6 May has Indirect Wealth but clashes with your stem; be careful. Keep June and July for holding, not moving.' }
